      "primary_persona": "sophie",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<!-- WCAG 1.3.5 | FAIL | Personas: Ian (autism), Elias (tremor), Sophie (cognitive)\n     Personal data fields have no autocomplete attributes. Browser cannot autofill.\n     Severity for Elias: CRITICAL - tremor makes manual typing extremely difficult.\n     Severity for Ian: SERIOUS - must recall and type personal info manually.\n     Severity for Sophie: SERIOUS - cognitive load of remembering account details. -->\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Profile Setup</title></head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Create Your Profile</h1>\n  <form>\n    <label for=\"fn\">First name</label>\n    <input id=\"fn\" type=\"text\" name=\"firstname\"><br>\n    <label for=\"ln\">Last name</label>\n    <input id=\"ln\" type=\"text\" name=\"lastname\"><br>\n    <label for=\"em\">Email</label>\n    <input id=\"em\" type=\"text\" name=\"email\"><br>\n    <label for=\"ph\">Phone number</label>\n    <input id=\"ph\" type=\"text\" name=\"phone\"><br>\n    <button type=\"submit\">Save profile</button>\n  </form>\n</body>\n</html>",
