      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<!-- WCAG 3.1.5 | PASS | SYNTHETIC | Persona: Sophie (Down syndrome, cognitive disability)\n     Text is written at Grade 6 reading level (Flesch-Kincaid ≈ 6, Flesch Reading Ease ≈ 72).\n     Short sentences. Common words. Active voice. Sophie can understand independently. -->\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>How to Vote</title></head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <h1>How to Vote in Your Local Election</h1>\n    <p>Voting is easy. Here are the steps to follow on election day.</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Go to your polling place. You can find it on your voter registration card.</li>\n      <li>Show your ID to the person at the desk.</li>\n      <li>They will give you a ballot.</li>\n      <li>Go to a private booth. Mark your choices on the ballot.</li>\n      <li>Put your ballot in the box.</li>\n      <li>You have voted! You may get a sticker.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p>If you need help, ask a poll worker. They are there to help you.</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>",
